---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import BrandLogo from "../components/BrandLogo.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Brand — A3S Labs" description="A3S Labs brand system, logo orientations, application rules and downloadable web-ready brand assets." canonicalPath="/brand">
  <section class="section-pad page-hero">
    <div class="shell brand-page-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span>A3S / BRAND</span><span>IDENTITY SYSTEM</span></p>
        <h1>One identity across every surface.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">The A3S Labs identity is built around a modular signal mark, a graphite-and-lime palette and lockups sized for products, infrastructure, research, mobile surfaces and social distribution.</p>
        <div class="brand-download">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/brand/A3S-Labs-Brand-Pack.zip" download>Download web brand pack <span>↓</span></a>
          <a class="button button-quiet" href="/contact">Contact A3S Labs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-page-banner"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-brand-banner.webp" alt="A3S Labs brand banner with the Software for systems that move, learn and operate tagline" width="1731" height="909" /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule">
    <div class="shell">
      <header class="section-heading split-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">Logo system</p><h2>Designed to survive orientation changes.</h2></div><p>Use the horizontal lockup when width is available, the stacked lockup in vertical or square compositions, and the mark alone when the interface is constrained.</p></header>
      <div class="brand-spec-grid">
        <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><BrandLogo variant="horizontal" /></div><h2>Primary horizontal</h2><p>Desktop navigation, document headers, wide banners and product attribution.</p></article>
        <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><BrandLogo variant="stacked" /></div><h2>Stacked</h2><p>Footer identity, square panels, presentation covers and vertical compositions.</p></article>
        <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><BrandLogo variant="mark" class="brand-mark-demo" alt="A3S Labs mark" /></div><h2>Mark</h2><p>Favicons, app icons, mobile headers, avatars and compact product surfaces.</p></article>
        <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media is-dark"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal-on-dark.webp" alt="A3S Labs horizontal logo for dark surfaces" /></div><h2>Dark surface</h2><p>Use the warm-neutral wordmark while preserving the acid-lime signal accent.</p></article>
        <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal.webp" alt="A3S Labs horizontal logo for light surfaces" /></div><h2>Light surface</h2><p>Use the graphite wordmark on warm-neutral and light backgrounds.</p></article>
        <article class="brand-spec"><div class="brand-spec-media"><img class="brand-mark-demo" src="/android-chrome-512x512.png" alt="A3S Labs application icon" /></div><h2>Application icon</h2><p>The mark remains identifiable from favicon scale through installable app surfaces.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad capability-band">
    <div class="shell brand-usage-grid">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">Core palette</p><h2>Three colors. One system.</h2></div>
      <div class="brand-palette">
        <div class="brand-swatch"><div class="brand-swatch-chip" style="background:#C6FF00"></div><b>Acid Lime</b><code>#C6FF00</code></div>
        <div class="brand-swatch"><div class="brand-swatch-chip" style="background:#111416"></div><b>Graphite</b><code>#111416</code></div>
        <div class="brand-swatch"><div class="brand-swatch-chip" style="background:#F4F2EE"></div><b>Warm Neutral</b><code>#F4F2EE</code></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule">
    <div class="shell brand-usage-grid">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">Responsive usage</p><h2>Desktop lockup. Mobile mark.</h2><p class="brand-bundle-note">The production site implements the same rule: full horizontal identity at desktop widths, then the standalone mark when navigation space becomes constrained.</p></div>
      <div class="brand-device-row">
        <div class="brand-device"><div class="brand-device-head"><span>Desktop</span><span>Horizontal</span></div><div class="brand-device-header"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-primary-horizontal-on-dark.webp" alt="" /><span class="brand-device-menu"></span></div></div>
        <div class="brand-device brand-device-mobile"><div class="brand-device-head"><span>Mobile</span><span>Mark</span></div><div class="brand-device-header"><img src="/brand/a3s-labs-mark.webp" alt="" /><span class="brand-device-menu"></span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad detail-band">
    <div class="shell brand-usage-grid">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">Usage rules</p><h2>Keep the identity recognizable.</h2></div>
      <div class="brand-rule-list">
        <div><span>01</span><p>Preserve the supplied proportions. Do not stretch, squash, rotate or redraw the mark.</p></div>
        <div><span>02</span><p>Keep the lime accent unchanged. It is the signal color that connects the parent identity across products.</p></div>
        <div><span>03</span><p>Choose the supplied light- or dark-surface lockup rather than adding shadows, outlines or improvised recoloring.</p></div>
        <div><span>04</span><p>At compact sizes, drop the wordmark before shrinking it beyond legibility; the mark is the intended small-surface identity.</p></div>
        <div><span>05</span><p>Maintain clear space around the identity approximately equal to the central node diameter in the mark.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad section-rule">
    <div class="shell brand-usage-grid">
      <div><p class="section-kicker">Asset bundle</p><h2>Web-ready files are packaged together.</h2></div>
      <div><p class="brand-bundle-note">The download contains optimized horizontal and stacked lockups, the standalone mark, favicon and app-icon sizes, the 1200×630 Open Graph artwork and the wide brand banner used by this site.</p><div class="brand-download"><a class="button button-primary" href="/brand/A3S-Labs-Brand-Pack.zip" download>Download brand pack <span>↓</span></a></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
